		{"id":"z2","type":"text","text":"## STREFA 2 — Monorepo\n\npnpm workspaces\napps/web + packages/shared\n\nworkspace:* = atomowy DTO\n**Default:** Monorepo 3–5 os.","x":-950,"y":-700,"width":380,"height":240,"color":"2"},
