		{"id":"z3","type":"text","text":"## STREFA 3 — Gałęzie\n\nGitFlow ❌ (merge hell)\nTrunk-Based + flags\nFeature Branch + PR ✓\n\nżycie branch ≤ 1–2 dni","x":-400,"y":-700,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"z4","type":"text","text":"## STREFA 4 — Lockfile\n\npnpm-lock.yaml → commit\n\ninstall = może zmienić lock\nfrozen-lockfile / npm ci\n= determinizm w CI","x":160,"y":-710,"width":380,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"z5","type":"text","text":"## STREFA 5 — Hooki lokalne\n\nHusky pre-commit\ncommit-msg (Conventional)\n\n--no-verify = bypass\n**DX only**","x":720,"y":-710,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"z6","type":"text","text":"## STREFA 6 — CI\n\nGitHub Actions ci.yml\nubuntu + frozen install\nlint → test → build\n\n**Autorytatywna bramka**","x":1270,"y":-700,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"z7","type":"text","text":"## STREFA 7 — Vaultie\n\nGit Submodule\nlabs/ + notatki 10_–50_\n\nagent widzi kod + KB\n→ input do 1.4 DoD","x":1800,"y":-700,"width":360,"height":200,"color":"1"},
